Thought: I will test the Generalized Lotka-Volterra (gLV) model by fitting      
$dx_i/dt = x_i (b_i + \sum A_{ij} x_j)$ for each variable $i$ using $dt=1.0$.   
I'll use a sparse regression with a threshold of 0.1 on the library $[1, x_0,   
