Thought: I will prepare the data by calculating the derivatives and setting up  
the feature matrices for linear regression. I'll test three models for each     
variable: purely linear, linear with bias, and linear with bias plus quadratic  
terms ($x_i^2$). I will then compare the residuals to determine the best fit for
