### 2. Task outcome (extremely detailed version):                               
The identification of the system dynamics was performed using the Sequential    
Thresholded Least Squares (STLS) algorithm, a standard method in Sparse         
Identification of Non-linear Dynamics (SINDy).                                  
                                                                                
**Data Preparation:**                                                           
- The provided data consisted of 9 state variables sampled at 10,001 time points
across 3 separate files.                                                        
